1
00:01:47,319 --> 00:01:47,719
Li Xiao.

2
00:01:52,159 --> 00:01:52,560
Lao Zhuang.

3
00:01:53,799 --> 00:01:54,439
I got one here.

4
00:01:54,439 --> 00:01:55,040
Where are you guys?

5
00:01:55,280 --> 00:01:56,120
We're still at the square.

6
00:01:56,159 --> 00:01:56,840
Got one here too.

7
00:01:58,239 --> 00:01:59,680
Want us to head over to you?

8
00:01:59,760 --> 00:02:01,200
No need. I'll meet up with you.

9
00:02:03,879 --> 00:02:05,200
You okay? Are you hurt?

10
00:02:09,159 --> 00:02:09,560
It hurts.

11
00:02:12,960 --> 00:02:13,319
I'm fine.

12
00:02:22,080 --> 00:02:23,080
Don't even think about running.

13
00:02:23,599 --> 00:02:24,400
If you try to run,

14
00:02:25,240 --> 00:02:26,120
I'll shoot you dead.

15
00:02:26,879 --> 00:02:28,479
I'm not planning to run just yet.

16
00:02:29,400 --> 00:02:30,400
Though I think

17
00:02:31,120 --> 00:02:32,319
before we reach our destination,

18
00:02:32,319 --> 00:02:34,719
anything is possible.

19
00:02:40,360 --> 00:02:41,599
You'd better cooperate later

20
00:02:42,400 --> 00:02:43,560
and tell us who

21
00:02:43,560 --> 00:02:45,120
ordered you to go after Qian.

22
00:02:50,960 --> 00:02:52,120
The game isn't over yet.

23
00:02:53,400 --> 00:02:54,919
Why should I show my hand?

24
00:02:56,719 --> 00:02:58,520
From the moment you committed your crime,

25
00:02:59,159 --> 00:03:00,759
your game was already over.

26
00:03:23,000 --> 00:03:24,800
There's something I've always wondered.

27
00:03:25,719 --> 00:03:27,039
Tell me, among you cops,

28
00:03:27,439 --> 00:03:29,360
how many have actually fired a gun?

29
00:03:32,360 --> 00:03:34,159
Under what circumstances can a cop shoot?

30
00:03:38,039 --> 00:03:39,759
Would you shoot someone in the back?

31
00:03:41,759 --> 00:03:42,280
Take a guess.

32
00:03:47,680 --> 00:03:48,639
I'm not guessing.

33
00:03:49,319 --> 00:03:50,599
Shooting, to me,

34
00:03:51,159 --> 00:03:52,400
is second nature.

35
00:03:56,719 --> 00:03:57,680
Someone like me...

36
00:03:58,439 --> 00:04:00,680
is destined to live in the line of fire.

37
00:04:01,680 --> 00:04:03,800
Even if I die by someone else's gun one day,

38
00:04:04,159 --> 00:04:05,400
I won't regret it.

39
00:04:13,000 --> 00:04:13,479
Watch out for the car!

40
00:05:27,800 --> 00:05:29,439
Li Liping was abducted

41
00:05:29,439 --> 00:05:30,600
after getting off work this afternoon.

42
00:05:31,240 --> 00:05:33,360
The doctor said she has no serious external injuries.

43
00:05:33,639 --> 00:05:34,519
She admitted it herself

44
00:05:34,839 --> 00:05:36,759
that the kidnapper didn't really violate her.

45
00:05:37,120 --> 00:05:38,360
But having been traumatized,

46
00:05:38,639 --> 00:05:39,920
she's not in a good mental state.

47
00:05:40,720 --> 00:05:41,519
I questioned her briefly.

48
00:05:41,759 --> 00:05:44,079
Regarding Qian Feng's drug dealings,

49
00:05:44,199 --> 00:05:45,040
she seems completely unaware.

50
00:05:45,480 --> 00:05:47,600
She was still expecting to go home with him.

51
00:05:48,439 --> 00:05:49,000
By the way,

52
00:05:49,839 --> 00:05:51,879
when do you plan to interrogate the suspect?

53
00:05:53,680 --> 00:05:54,720
The suspect was just captured.

54
00:05:54,839 --> 00:05:56,360
His psychological defense is still weak,

55
00:05:56,600 --> 00:05:58,360
so we're going to interrogate him immediately.

56
00:05:58,639 --> 00:05:58,879
All right.

57
00:05:59,319 --> 00:06:00,480
I'll send people to assist you.

58
00:06:05,439 --> 00:06:07,120
Boss, the search team spotted the suspect.

59
00:06:08,639 --> 00:06:09,199
Officer!

60
00:06:09,399 --> 00:06:11,160
He jumped into my yard right over there,

61
00:06:11,680 --> 00:06:13,399
stole some clothes, and took off running.

62
00:06:13,720 --> 00:06:14,519
I couldn't catch him,

63
00:06:14,519 --> 00:06:15,279
so I called the police right away.

64
00:06:17,680 --> 00:06:19,160
Are you sure he ran in that direction?

65
00:06:20,399 --> 00:06:20,879
Positive.

66
00:06:21,000 --> 00:06:22,319
Yes, he ran toward that way.

67
00:06:22,319 --> 00:06:23,160
I saw it with my own eyes.

68
00:06:23,160 --> 00:06:23,639
Captain Cheng.

69
00:06:29,920 --> 00:06:31,199
Captain Cheng! Captain Cheng!

70
00:06:31,920 --> 00:06:32,360
Take a look.

71
00:06:38,959 --> 00:06:39,800
It's the suspect's

72
00:06:40,480 --> 00:06:41,000
scent article.

73
00:06:41,040 --> 00:06:41,360
Yes, sir.

74
00:06:48,079 --> 00:06:49,120
All right. Good work.

75
00:10:47,639 --> 00:10:48,759
I'm pretty useless, aren't I?

76
00:10:52,720 --> 00:10:53,840
Tian Xin left me,

77
00:10:57,240 --> 00:10:59,039
and the drug dealer slipped right through my fingers.

78
00:11:18,919 --> 00:11:19,879
You know why?

79
00:11:23,360 --> 00:11:25,480
If the dealers run, catch them.

80
00:11:25,879 --> 00:11:26,919
Tian Xin left,

81
00:11:27,639 --> 00:11:28,559
then win her back.

82
00:11:33,919 --> 00:11:34,600
Don't chicken out.

83
00:11:38,000 --> 00:11:38,919
Prove it to yourself.

84
00:12:17,200 --> 00:12:17,799
Sir.

85
00:12:19,559 --> 00:12:19,960
Sir!

86
00:12:57,399 --> 00:12:59,159
Currently, on Shuncheng Avenue

87
00:12:59,159 --> 00:13:00,720
and Shaodong Avenue, traffic is congested.

88
00:13:00,720 --> 00:13:02,320
Please take detours if possible.

89
00:13:03,039 --> 00:13:04,360
Next is a police bulletin.

90
00:13:04,960 --> 00:13:07,240
Between four and five this morning,

91
00:13:07,480 --> 00:13:10,039
a fugitive suspect entered Mount Ciyun.

92
00:13:10,840 --> 00:13:12,960
If you spot anyone suspicious, please call the police.

93
00:13:17,279 --> 00:13:18,159
Four-Legged Snake.

94
00:13:19,960 --> 00:13:20,639
What's that?

95
00:13:22,200 --> 00:13:24,000
I have no idea what you're talking about.

96
00:13:25,279 --> 00:13:26,159
You've been dealing drugs for so long,

97
00:13:27,440 --> 00:13:29,279
yet the biggest drug syndicates in Nanhai...

98
00:13:29,279 --> 00:13:30,320
you know nothing about them?

99
00:13:32,240 --> 00:13:32,799
Officer,

100
00:13:33,360 --> 00:13:35,559
I'm just a businessman trying to make money.

101
00:13:36,720 --> 00:13:38,039
Why would I care about any of that?

102
00:13:39,320 --> 00:13:42,279
Besides, I never thought about joining

103
00:13:42,639 --> 00:13:43,960
any criminal syndicate.

104
00:13:45,279 --> 00:13:46,039
Watch your attitude.

105
00:13:51,240 --> 00:13:52,320
The people who kidnapped your ex-wife

106
00:13:52,320 --> 00:13:54,159
were sent by Four-Legged Snake's crew.

107
00:13:54,159 --> 00:13:54,919
You didn't know?

108
00:14:00,200 --> 00:14:02,080
Even if you don't say it, we understand.

109
00:14:03,440 --> 00:14:05,000
The reason they kidnapped your family

110
00:14:05,519 --> 00:14:06,759
is that they're afraid you'd disclose

111
00:14:06,759 --> 00:14:07,960
too much information to the police.

112
00:14:07,960 --> 00:14:09,320
That's why they kidnapped your family—

113
00:14:09,320 --> 00:14:10,159
to threaten you.

114
00:14:10,679 --> 00:14:11,279
Right?

115
00:14:12,600 --> 00:14:13,080
Officer,

116
00:14:14,600 --> 00:14:17,480
how could I have all those drug cartels behind me?

117
00:14:21,360 --> 00:14:22,279
Look, officers,

118
00:14:23,039 --> 00:14:23,919
didn't you arrest me

119
00:14:24,559 --> 00:14:25,639
just to have me confess

120
00:14:25,639 --> 00:14:26,960
to my crimes?

121
00:14:27,159 --> 00:14:28,919
I never said I wouldn't talk.

122
00:14:30,519 --> 00:14:31,519
Whatever I did,

123
00:14:31,559 --> 00:14:32,159
I'll admit to it all.

124
00:14:32,919 --> 00:14:34,559
But why is it that up until now,

125
00:14:35,360 --> 00:14:36,960
you haven't asked me a single thing

126
00:14:37,519 --> 00:14:38,919
about my drug dealing?

127
00:14:39,440 --> 00:14:41,440
Fine. Great attitude. We're listening.

128
00:14:41,919 --> 00:14:42,320
Take notes.

129
00:14:44,799 --> 00:14:45,240
Go ahead.

130
00:14:45,960 --> 00:14:47,639
When did you start trafficking drugs?

131
00:14:47,840 --> 00:14:49,639
Who were your initial contacts?

132
00:14:50,480 --> 00:14:51,200
Who did you get the supply from?

133
00:14:51,720 --> 00:14:53,200
And who did you sell to once you got the drugs?

134
00:14:54,000 --> 00:14:56,200
Officers, if you ask it like that,

135
00:14:56,200 --> 00:14:57,559
then I know how to answer.

136
00:14:58,960 --> 00:15:00,240
It was in March of this year

137
00:15:00,240 --> 00:15:01,879
that I got into this business.

138
00:15:02,759 --> 00:15:04,639
I got my supply from

139
00:15:04,639 --> 00:15:06,879
Cheng Weimin at Jiangyang Xinghai Trading Company.

140
00:15:07,879 --> 00:15:09,840
Every time, I had him find a logistics company

141
00:15:10,759 --> 00:15:12,480
to hide the drugs in cosmetics,

142
00:15:13,120 --> 00:15:14,519
and then ship them

143
00:15:14,519 --> 00:15:16,519
to the beauty parlor run by my girlfriend, Gao Min.

144
00:15:17,360 --> 00:15:18,360
Once I received the goods,

145
00:15:19,360 --> 00:15:21,039
I took them to those drug dens

146
00:15:21,240 --> 00:15:22,200
and nightclubs to sell.

147
00:15:24,480 --> 00:15:25,039
I know

148
00:15:25,879 --> 00:15:28,080
you just want to bust those drug dens,

149
00:15:28,080 --> 00:15:28,600
right?

150
00:15:28,759 --> 00:15:30,639
Alright, give me a moment to think.

151
00:15:30,960 --> 00:15:31,519
I promise

152
00:15:32,200 --> 00:15:33,960
I'll rat out every single one of them.

153
00:15:34,279 --> 00:15:35,720
When you go raid those drug dens,

154
00:15:35,759 --> 00:15:37,960
you'll catch someone every single time.

155
00:15:38,000 --> 00:15:39,919
Officer, doing this...

156
00:15:40,840 --> 00:15:42,840
should count as redeem oneself through merit, right?

157
00:15:51,159 --> 00:15:53,639
Seven of your drug dens are listed here.

158
00:15:53,639 --> 00:15:55,000
We've already busted five of them.

159
00:15:55,720 --> 00:15:56,600
All the suspects involved

160
00:15:56,600 --> 00:15:58,440
have already been brought to justice.

161
00:15:59,759 --> 00:16:01,039
The remaining two drug dens,

162
00:16:01,840 --> 00:16:02,799
to you right now,

163
00:16:02,799 --> 00:16:03,960
are probably insignificant anyway.

164
00:16:08,960 --> 00:16:11,360
Qian Feng, have you ever actually thought about cooperating?

165
00:16:15,559 --> 00:16:16,159
Cooperating?

166
00:16:16,679 --> 00:16:17,519
Didn't I already say?

167
00:16:18,159 --> 00:16:19,399
No matter what you ask me,

168
00:16:20,279 --> 00:16:21,440
I will confess truthfully.

169
00:16:27,799 --> 00:16:29,559
Through Zhongtian Logistics,

170
00:16:30,679 --> 00:16:31,679
the drugs you transported...

171
00:16:31,759 --> 00:16:32,639
it was at least seven times.

172
00:16:33,279 --> 00:16:34,480
Every single time, you slipped past security.

173
00:16:35,240 --> 00:16:37,399
Was that pure luck?

174
00:16:50,399 --> 00:16:53,120
This is a full list of senior executives

175
00:16:53,120 --> 00:16:54,240
from Zhongtian Logistics' Nanhai branch.

176
00:16:55,120 --> 00:16:56,559
We want you to take a good look,

177
00:16:57,399 --> 00:17:00,399
and tell us who on here worked with you.

178
00:17:04,519 --> 00:17:05,599
That's impossible.

179
00:17:06,799 --> 00:17:07,200
There's no one.

180
00:17:07,960 --> 00:17:08,759
Absolutely no one.

181
00:17:09,200 --> 00:17:10,519
How could I possibly know

182
00:17:10,519 --> 00:17:12,240
these executives and big bosses?

183
00:17:18,319 --> 00:17:18,720
Fine.

184
00:17:19,640 --> 00:17:20,920
I'll just tell you the truth.

185
00:17:21,200 --> 00:17:22,279
Actually, lots of logistics companies,

186
00:17:22,279 --> 00:17:23,640
when they do inspections,

187
00:17:24,200 --> 00:17:25,960
are careless and full of loopholes.

188
00:17:26,559 --> 00:17:27,680
All I did was exploit

189
00:17:27,680 --> 00:17:28,759
loopholes in their management.

190
00:17:28,920 --> 00:17:29,680
Impossible.

191
00:17:30,319 --> 00:17:31,200
You moved shipments so many times,

192
00:17:31,200 --> 00:17:32,240
and in such massive amounts.

193
00:17:32,519 --> 00:17:34,559
If you weren't 100 percent sure,

194
00:17:34,559 --> 00:17:35,839
you never would've taken that risk.

195
00:17:37,160 --> 00:17:37,680
Qian Feng.

196
00:17:38,279 --> 00:17:40,640
You definitely had an insider working with you.

197
00:17:59,240 --> 00:18:01,759
We were going to take your ex-wife and daughter home,

198
00:18:02,559 --> 00:18:05,759
but they wanted to see you first.

199
00:18:18,480 --> 00:18:22,440
Are you trying to cut a deal with me?

200
00:18:22,759 --> 00:18:24,200
I want you to think about your daughter.

201
00:18:24,480 --> 00:18:25,640
I think she already knows

202
00:18:25,640 --> 00:18:27,119
she has a criminal for a father.

203
00:18:27,119 --> 00:18:28,440
When she grows up,

204
00:18:29,079 --> 00:18:30,799
do you want your ex-wife to tell her

205
00:18:31,160 --> 00:18:33,880
that her father remained unrepentant to the end,

206
00:18:34,640 --> 00:18:35,759
or that he turned over a new leaf?

207
00:18:47,799 --> 00:18:49,559
Now that things have come to this,

208
00:18:51,640 --> 00:18:52,839
I had no choice,

209
00:18:54,039 --> 00:18:54,920
and I accept my defeat.

210
00:18:59,279 --> 00:19:00,720
I've already told you clearly

211
00:19:00,720 --> 00:19:01,640
so many times.

212
00:19:01,960 --> 00:19:03,160
The one who supplied my drugs

213
00:19:03,160 --> 00:19:05,960
was Cheng Weimin from Jiangyang Xinghai Trading Company.

214
00:19:06,720 --> 00:19:07,920
And as for the distribution dens,

215
00:19:07,920 --> 00:19:09,160
I've told you many times already.

216
00:19:09,359 --> 00:19:10,359
I really don't know.

217
00:19:10,720 --> 00:19:12,720
What else do you want me to say?

218
00:19:13,319 --> 00:19:14,119
Where did the drug money go?

219
00:19:15,119 --> 00:19:16,759
If you didn't pay it to your supplier,

220
00:19:16,759 --> 00:19:17,920
where did your drug money go?

221
00:19:19,079 --> 00:19:21,759
Officer, I've told you this many times too.

222
00:19:21,880 --> 00:19:23,440
Cheng Weimin is my supplier.

223
00:19:23,440 --> 00:19:24,960
The profits from selling the drugs

224
00:19:25,160 --> 00:19:26,640
weren't pocketed by me alone.

225
00:19:26,640 --> 00:19:28,559
Cheng Weimin took the lion's share.

226
00:19:28,559 --> 00:19:30,240
How did you give the drug money to Cheng Weimin?

227
00:19:30,599 --> 00:19:31,720
Every time after selling the drugs,

228
00:19:31,720 --> 00:19:33,720
I used Li Xia's Alipay

229
00:19:33,720 --> 00:19:34,599
to withdraw cash,

230
00:19:34,599 --> 00:19:36,720
and paid Cheng Weimin directly in cash.

231
00:19:36,720 --> 00:19:37,799
Handed it to him in person, right?

232
00:19:38,039 --> 00:19:38,759
Of course.

233
00:19:39,119 --> 00:19:40,319
Except Cheng Weimin is in Jiangyang.

234
00:19:41,039 --> 00:19:42,200
You couldn't have gone all the way to Jiangyang

235
00:19:42,200 --> 00:19:43,640
in person every time you paid him.

236
00:19:48,079 --> 00:19:49,000
If there wasn't someone

237
00:19:49,720 --> 00:19:51,279
coordinating between the two of you,

238
00:19:51,839 --> 00:19:52,680
how could he trust you?

239
00:19:53,920 --> 00:19:55,680
Each of your shipments was worth at least a million.

240
00:19:55,839 --> 00:19:58,119
Why would he let you take goods on credit?

241
00:19:58,720 --> 00:20:00,759
You might not believe this,

242
00:20:00,960 --> 00:20:02,599
but I'm in this business.

243
00:20:03,480 --> 00:20:06,319
Without mutual trust between supplier and dealer,

244
00:20:06,319 --> 00:20:07,920
this business simply couldn't work.

245
00:20:08,200 --> 00:20:09,319
Besides, you can check

246
00:20:09,319 --> 00:20:10,680
my flight records.

247
00:20:10,839 --> 00:20:12,559
Over these eleven months this year,

248
00:20:12,559 --> 00:20:14,240
I flew to Jiangyang twice.

249
00:20:14,759 --> 00:20:15,920
Doing business with Cheng Weimin,

250
00:20:16,640 --> 00:20:18,279
he was in charge of shipping the goods,

251
00:20:18,279 --> 00:20:19,400
and I was in charge of selling them.

252
00:20:19,519 --> 00:20:20,759
We settled the books every six months.

253
00:20:21,200 --> 00:20:22,240
I handed him the cash directly.

254
00:20:22,240 --> 00:20:22,920
It's as simple as that.

255
00:20:23,519 --> 00:20:24,279
Trust?

256
00:20:26,160 --> 00:20:26,839
Simple indeed.

257
00:20:28,200 --> 00:20:29,799
So simple it's hard to believe.

258
00:20:34,480 --> 00:20:34,960
How about this?

259
00:20:38,759 --> 00:20:40,799
Have his ex-wife and daughter come see him.

260
00:20:45,039 --> 00:20:46,480
The guy on the run is named Huang Weiguang,

261
00:20:47,039 --> 00:20:47,799
35 years old.

262
00:20:48,759 --> 00:20:51,000
He has quite a rap sheet.

263
00:20:51,640 --> 00:20:54,039
For robbery and intentional assault,

264
00:20:54,200 --> 00:20:55,279
he was sentenced to seven years in prison,

265
00:20:55,720 --> 00:20:57,000
and was released just one year ago.

266
00:20:58,480 --> 00:21:00,119
These three men share something in common:

267
00:21:01,440 --> 00:21:03,559
they've all spent time in Chang'an.

268
00:21:04,240 --> 00:21:05,799
So we suspect these three

269
00:21:06,160 --> 00:21:07,400
have ties to

270
00:21:07,559 --> 00:21:08,559
the local organized crime syndicates.

271
00:21:12,319 --> 00:21:14,000
出现过 -> showed up. Correct.
Li Qiang also showed up in Chang'an before.

272
00:21:14,640 --> 00:21:17,319
Could this crew

273
00:21:17,519 --> 00:21:18,839
possibly be linked to the drug cartel

274
00:21:18,839 --> 00:21:19,960
run by the man known as Boss Ma?

275
00:21:20,519 --> 00:21:22,559
When Qian Feng's drug dealing was at its peak,

276
00:21:22,920 --> 00:21:24,279
it was right when Li Qiang and his crew

277
00:21:24,279 --> 00:21:25,519
were lying low elsewhere.

278
00:21:26,720 --> 00:21:28,519
After Li Qiang and his crew returned to Nanhai,

279
00:21:28,880 --> 00:21:30,240
the only deal they set up

280
00:21:30,880 --> 00:21:31,880
was the one with Mu Qing.

281
00:21:31,880 --> 00:21:32,640
From the look of it,

282
00:21:33,200 --> 00:21:33,920
these three men

283
00:21:34,200 --> 00:21:36,119
probably don't work for this Ma guy.

284
00:21:37,440 --> 00:21:38,599
There's still something I don't get.

285
00:21:39,400 --> 00:21:40,839
The cartel brought these three in

286
00:21:41,000 --> 00:21:43,000
to kidnap Li Liping to blackmail Qian Feng.

287
00:21:43,839 --> 00:21:45,400
So why did they let her go halfway through?

288
00:21:45,640 --> 00:21:46,920
They wanted Qian Feng to know

289
00:21:47,559 --> 00:21:49,240
that they could threaten his family's safety

290
00:21:49,240 --> 00:21:50,160
anytime, anywhere.

291
00:21:51,519 --> 00:21:53,680
But if we had stopped the kidnapping,

292
00:21:54,359 --> 00:21:55,279
we'd have a stronger hand

293
00:21:55,920 --> 00:21:57,359
in interrogating Qian Feng.

294
00:21:59,480 --> 00:22:00,119
We kept thinking

295
00:22:00,119 --> 00:22:01,839
the kidnappers' target was Qian Feng's daughter.

296
00:22:03,079 --> 00:22:04,599
Who knew it would be Li Liping?

297
00:22:08,160 --> 00:22:10,200
Even though Qian Feng is divorced from Li Liping,

298
00:22:11,279 --> 00:22:12,240
the daughter's fate

299
00:22:12,240 --> 00:22:14,319
will always be tied to her mother's.

300
00:22:14,759 --> 00:22:15,880
Qian Feng knows that in his heart,

301
00:22:16,559 --> 00:22:17,200
and so do the kidnappers.

302
00:22:18,720 --> 00:22:19,720
Yet we overlooked it.

303
00:22:25,440 --> 00:22:27,519
That's all the intel we have for now.

304
00:22:27,680 --> 00:22:29,000
How about we follow Captain Bai's lead,

305
00:22:29,079 --> 00:22:30,319
take Qian Feng back to Nanhai,

306
00:22:30,319 --> 00:22:31,200
and let her interrogate him?

307
00:22:31,200 --> 00:22:33,440
We'll also step up our manhunt for Huang Weiguang.

308
00:22:34,400 --> 00:22:35,839
What Qian Feng fears most right now

309
00:22:36,000 --> 00:22:38,160
is that Huang Weiguang might hurt his family again.

310
00:22:38,799 --> 00:22:42,240
So as long as Huang Weiguang is on the run,

311
00:22:42,799 --> 00:22:44,160
it'll be tough to get

312
00:22:44,160 --> 00:22:46,359
any more useful intel out of Qian Feng.

313
00:22:48,519 --> 00:22:49,680
As for the hunt for Huang Weiguang,

314
00:22:50,880 --> 00:22:51,559
count me in.

315
00:23:06,240 --> 00:23:07,680
Based on the leads we have so far,

316
00:23:08,359 --> 00:23:09,000
we suspect

317
00:23:09,319 --> 00:23:10,880
Zhongtian Logistics' transport routes

318
00:23:11,240 --> 00:23:13,440
have become secret channels for drug trafficking.

319
00:23:14,200 --> 00:23:15,240
The prime suspect

320
00:23:15,240 --> 00:23:17,519
is Zhou Fuhai, account manager at Zhongtian Logistics.

321
00:23:18,400 --> 00:23:19,880
In addition, partners of Zhongtian Logistics,

322
00:23:19,880 --> 00:23:22,160
like Chaoqing Online Store

323
00:23:22,319 --> 00:23:23,200
and Yike Gifts,

324
00:23:23,599 --> 00:23:25,240
are very likely, just like Qian Feng,

325
00:23:25,599 --> 00:23:28,559
trafficking drugs through logistics channels.

326
00:23:31,200 --> 00:23:31,839
How's the progress?

327
00:23:33,279 --> 00:23:35,240
Qian Feng has already been brought in,

328
00:23:35,400 --> 00:23:36,720
but because his family

329
00:23:36,839 --> 00:23:38,000
was previously threatened,

330
00:23:38,200 --> 00:23:41,119
he refuses to give up his handler's details.

331
00:23:43,680 --> 00:23:45,960
I've already instructed Zhuang Yan and Ge Dan

332
00:23:46,200 --> 00:23:47,440
to bring Qian Feng back.

333
00:23:47,640 --> 00:23:49,799
Meanwhile, Li Xiao insisted on staying in Yangchuan

334
00:23:49,799 --> 00:23:52,039
to help local police capture Huang Weiguang.

335
00:23:53,720 --> 00:23:55,680
Tell Li Xiao to hurry up.

336
00:23:56,319 --> 00:23:57,640
Only after Huang Weiguang is caught

337
00:23:58,160 --> 00:23:59,359
will Qian Feng have the courage

338
00:23:59,559 --> 00:24:01,119
to expose the drug ring behind him.

339
00:24:03,920 --> 00:24:05,680
Could the suspect have already driven

340
00:24:05,680 --> 00:24:07,359
the hijacked vehicle out of Yangchuan?

341
00:24:11,359 --> 00:24:13,359
Every checkpoint in the city is locked down tight.

342
00:24:14,799 --> 00:24:16,039
He won't risk it.

343
00:24:16,519 --> 00:24:17,319
My guess is

344
00:24:18,079 --> 00:24:19,039
he'll lay low for a few more days

345
00:24:19,920 --> 00:24:21,440
and leave when the timing is right.

346
00:24:26,319 --> 00:24:29,000
Report: By the bridge on Chida River Street,

347
00:24:29,000 --> 00:24:30,559
the suspect's hijacked vehicle has been found.

348
00:24:31,440 --> 00:24:32,079
Copy that, copy that.

349
00:24:32,240 --> 00:24:33,720
We're close by. Heading over right now.

350
00:24:50,000 --> 00:24:51,240
Two phones. What else?

351
00:24:51,519 --> 00:24:53,200
My bag. My bag's still in the car.

352
00:24:55,799 --> 00:24:56,839
Is anything missing?

353
00:24:58,920 --> 00:24:59,799
Everything's still here.

354
00:25:08,519 --> 00:25:08,960
Captain Cheng.

355
00:25:09,240 --> 00:25:10,440
Did you verify with the owner?

356
00:25:10,880 --> 00:25:11,519
Confirmed.

357
00:25:11,880 --> 00:25:12,359
This morning,

358
00:25:12,400 --> 00:25:13,960
the two of them were at the foot of Mount Ciyun

359
00:25:14,000 --> 00:25:15,119
and got carjacked by Huang Weiguang.

360
00:25:16,160 --> 00:25:18,400
Traffic spotted the car 30 minutes ago.

361
00:25:18,759 --> 00:25:19,559
Did you check the surveillance?

362
00:25:19,799 --> 00:25:21,119
There are no cameras within several kilometers.

363
00:25:22,480 --> 00:25:23,240
When was it reported?

364
00:25:24,240 --> 00:25:25,200
Just past 11:00 AM.

365
00:25:27,359 --> 00:25:28,480
When your car was hijacked,

366
00:25:28,480 --> 00:25:29,319
what time was it, roughly?

367
00:25:30,160 --> 00:25:30,960
Past eight.

368
00:25:31,119 --> 00:25:32,160
Close to nine.

369
00:25:32,920 --> 00:25:34,559
Both of our phones were taken.

370
00:25:34,920 --> 00:25:36,359
We had to walk down the mountain.

371
00:25:48,920 --> 00:25:50,240
He could now be hiding

372
00:25:50,240 --> 00:25:51,960
in any corner of this city.

373
00:26:01,400 --> 00:26:02,319
Huang Weiguang knows

374
00:26:02,759 --> 00:26:05,000
he can't drive the hijacked vehicle

375
00:26:05,200 --> 00:26:06,000
out of Yangchuan,

376
00:26:07,240 --> 00:26:09,079
which is why he spared those two witnesses.

377
00:26:09,759 --> 00:26:11,000
What we're facing this time

378
00:26:12,000 --> 00:26:13,359
isn't just a hitman,

379
00:26:14,359 --> 00:26:15,720
but a seasoned criminal.

380
00:26:16,440 --> 00:26:18,279
When we first crossed paths in Nanhai,

381
00:26:19,279 --> 00:26:21,240
he not only got Qian Feng out,

382
00:26:21,519 --> 00:26:23,279
but kept his own identity concealed.

383
00:26:24,440 --> 00:26:25,279
And while our attention

384
00:26:25,279 --> 00:26:26,519
was focused on Qian Shu,

385
00:26:26,559 --> 00:26:27,720
he still managed, cool and unhurried,

386
00:26:27,720 --> 00:26:28,880
to kidnap Li Liping.

387
00:26:29,200 --> 00:26:30,039
This man

388
00:26:31,119 --> 00:26:31,920
is remarkably composed.

389
00:26:32,839 --> 00:26:33,920
Everything he does

390
00:26:35,759 --> 00:26:36,839
has a clear objective.

391
00:26:38,400 --> 00:26:40,920
Those two witnesses survived today

392
00:26:41,640 --> 00:26:43,160
not because he showed mercy,

393
00:26:43,160 --> 00:26:44,079
but because he knew

394
00:26:44,319 --> 00:26:45,240
killing them

395
00:26:45,920 --> 00:26:48,119
would only expose him that much sooner.

396
00:26:54,119 --> 00:26:55,359
But now that he's blended into

397
00:26:55,359 --> 00:26:56,720
the vast crowd,

398
00:26:58,319 --> 00:26:59,920
how are we supposed to find him?

399
00:27:01,160 --> 00:27:01,720
We wait.

400
00:27:03,039 --> 00:27:04,200
He will definitely slip up.

401
00:27:10,079 --> 00:27:11,119
The report is almost ready.

402
00:27:11,839 --> 00:27:12,839
I can send it over tomorrow.

403
00:27:15,440 --> 00:27:16,000
Okay.

404
00:27:16,400 --> 00:27:16,759
Alright.

405
00:27:17,200 --> 00:27:17,559
Goodbye.

406
00:27:41,839 --> 00:27:43,640
He definitely has no idea I'm back.

407
00:27:43,680 --> 00:27:45,759
I just wanted to surprise him.

408
00:27:47,839 --> 00:27:50,359
I'll sneak up behind him in a bit,

409
00:27:50,359 --> 00:27:51,680
and give him a good scare.

410
00:31:51,200 --> 00:31:52,640
All the recent evidence of their crimes

411
00:31:52,839 --> 00:31:53,640
is in here.

412
00:31:55,160 --> 00:31:56,920
Have they set the time and place for the deal?

413
00:31:57,400 --> 00:31:58,200
Not yet.

414
00:31:58,759 --> 00:32:00,720
But he takes this deal very seriously,

415
00:32:01,200 --> 00:32:02,880
so he'll make a move soon.

416
00:32:04,200 --> 00:32:04,839
Keep a close eye on them.

417
00:32:05,039 --> 00:32:06,240
Moving this much product all at once...

418
00:32:06,440 --> 00:32:07,640
they're probably planning to run.

419
00:32:08,440 --> 00:32:10,359
This might be our last chance to arrest him.

420
00:32:11,440 --> 00:32:12,319
If we're lucky enough,

421
00:32:13,000 --> 00:32:14,200
we might catch both of them.

422
00:32:18,279 --> 00:32:18,920
Stay safe.

423
00:32:20,599 --> 00:32:21,400
Be careful out there.

424
00:35:18,280 --> 00:35:19,800
It's already been 36 hours.

425
00:35:20,280 --> 00:35:21,519
I wonder if Huang Weiguang has fled.

426
00:35:22,559 --> 00:35:23,559
I don't think he ran.

427
00:35:24,760 --> 00:35:25,559
He's right here,

428
00:35:26,079 --> 00:35:27,960
patiently waiting for us to let our guard down.

429
00:36:31,760 --> 00:36:32,280
Go ahead.

430
00:36:32,800 --> 00:36:33,400
Boss,

431
00:36:33,599 --> 00:36:35,320
we got a report at three this afternoon.

432
00:36:35,519 --> 00:36:37,440
Outside Unit Three, Building Five of Fuli Community,

433
00:36:37,480 --> 00:36:39,039
someone found a note

434
00:36:39,039 --> 00:36:41,079
with an SOS and an address on it.

435
00:36:41,400 --> 00:36:42,840
After receiving the emergency call,

436
00:36:42,840 --> 00:36:43,960
officers rushed to the scene immediately.

437
00:36:44,440 --> 00:36:45,800
Surveillance footage from the scene

438
00:36:46,440 --> 00:36:48,159
confirmed the suspect is Huang Weiguang.

439
00:36:48,880 --> 00:36:50,719
Officers are currently monitoring the site,

440
00:36:51,320 --> 00:36:52,800
but since there's a hostage involved,

441
00:36:52,800 --> 00:36:54,440
we haven't made a move yet.

442
00:36:56,320 --> 00:36:58,039
Suspect Huang Weiguang's location confirmed.

443
00:36:58,239 --> 00:36:58,840
He's at Xinhua Lanting.

444
00:36:59,079 --> 00:37:01,320
How fast can we get to Xinhua Lanting from here?

445
00:37:01,400 --> 00:37:02,760
Not far. Ten minutes at most.

446
00:37:03,000 --> 00:37:03,480
Head there now.

447
00:37:03,559 --> 00:37:03,800
Copy that.

448
00:38:45,679 --> 00:38:47,280
Help! Help!

449
00:38:48,039 --> 00:38:48,960
Somebody help!

450
00:38:49,320 --> 00:38:49,920
Help!

451
00:38:52,519 --> 00:38:53,079
Drop the knife!

452
00:38:54,679 --> 00:38:55,199
Stay back!

453
00:38:56,559 --> 00:38:57,400
Come any closer and I'll kill her!

454
00:38:57,480 --> 00:38:58,000
Huang Weiguang.

455
00:38:58,599 --> 00:38:59,679
You have no way out.

456
00:39:05,800 --> 00:39:07,119
I never had a chance anyway!

457
00:39:08,920 --> 00:39:09,679
Cut the crap!

458
00:39:09,840 --> 00:39:10,400
Huang Weiguang,

459
00:39:11,239 --> 00:39:12,599
with all these guns pointed at you,

460
00:39:12,760 --> 00:39:14,119
do you really think you can get away?

461
00:39:15,880 --> 00:39:17,320
If I can't, I'll take someone down with me!

462
00:39:17,719 --> 00:39:18,760
If you don't want to see

463
00:39:18,760 --> 00:39:19,920
another person die,

464
00:39:20,639 --> 00:39:21,119
drop your guns!

465
00:39:21,960 --> 00:39:22,559
Let me go!

466
00:39:24,519 --> 00:39:25,360
Drop your guns!

467
00:39:26,000 --> 00:39:26,559
All right.

468
00:39:27,800 --> 00:39:28,480
We'll let you go.

469
00:39:28,880 --> 00:39:29,679
Release the hostage.

470
00:39:37,800 --> 00:39:38,239
You.

471
00:39:40,800 --> 00:39:41,480
Throw it over.

472
00:39:52,360 --> 00:39:52,800
Step back!

473
00:40:34,719 --> 00:40:35,320
Call an ambulance!

474
00:40:35,320 --> 00:40:35,679
Yes, sir!

475
00:41:04,559 --> 00:41:05,639
We were still one step too late.

476
00:41:08,599 --> 00:41:10,800
As cops, all we can do is try our best

477
00:41:10,800 --> 00:41:11,880
to protect the public.

478
00:41:12,440 --> 00:41:13,199
Some accidents

479
00:41:13,360 --> 00:41:14,840
simply can't be foreseen or controlled.

480
00:41:17,599 --> 00:41:18,719
Good thing your shot was right on target.

481
00:41:19,159 --> 00:41:20,239
Otherwise, the hostage would've been killed.

482
00:41:22,440 --> 00:41:23,800
If you hadn't hidden your gun so well,

483
00:41:26,119 --> 00:41:27,719
I wouldn't have had the chance to save the hostage.

484
00:41:31,679 --> 00:41:33,039
What made you think of hiding a gun?

485
00:41:35,039 --> 00:41:36,400
Have you ever seen a John Woo movie?

486
00:41:50,199 --> 00:41:51,159
Captain Bai, Captain Lu.

487
00:41:52,039 --> 00:41:52,599
You're back.

488
00:41:53,079 --> 00:41:53,719
Good work.

489
00:41:53,920 --> 00:41:54,559
Not at all.

490
00:41:54,920 --> 00:41:56,280
Except that blockhead Zhuang Yan...

491
00:41:56,280 --> 00:41:57,400
talked about the case the whole way.

492
00:41:58,719 --> 00:41:59,840
That must have been rough, then.

493
00:42:01,119 --> 00:42:02,079
I heard that Qian Feng...

494
00:42:02,119 --> 00:42:03,480
took the blame for everything alone.

495
00:42:04,440 --> 00:42:06,760
The syndicate threatened Qian Feng's family

496
00:42:07,440 --> 00:42:08,639
basically to Sacrifice a pawn to save the king.

497
00:42:09,639 --> 00:42:11,199
Besides, on the logistics company's client list,

498
00:42:11,559 --> 00:42:12,679
there are two other suspects.

499
00:42:13,559 --> 00:42:15,280
Qian Feng is worried about his family's safety,

500
00:42:15,519 --> 00:42:16,840
which is why he refuses to tell the truth.

501
00:42:17,559 --> 00:42:19,440
If we can track down Huang Weiguang soon,

502
00:42:19,920 --> 00:42:21,119
we might still turn the tables.

503
00:42:22,760 --> 00:42:23,639
Don't worry.

504
00:42:23,840 --> 00:42:24,920
Li Xiao is already looking into it.

505
00:42:25,039 --> 00:42:27,280
You two have had a long journey.

506
00:42:27,440 --> 00:42:28,039
You must be exhausted.

507
00:42:28,239 --> 00:42:28,960
Go get some rest.

508
00:42:29,880 --> 00:42:30,440
Thank you, Captain.

509
00:42:32,960 --> 00:42:33,960
Breaks are rare.

510
00:42:33,960 --> 00:42:35,840
Let's go grab a coffee, then.

511
00:42:41,719 --> 00:42:42,320
Thanks, Captain Bai.

512
00:42:50,199 --> 00:42:52,400
Zhuang Yan is finally catching on.

513
00:42:53,760 --> 00:42:54,519
You're overthinking it.
